<DATA=Code>
  2009-01-01 12:00  => IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* SSG-4 archive work (MT-050): one ARCHIFORMAT for all calls. Key,
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* record length, column count and names come from the SGSPARM
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* file written by the skeleton hand-off; behaviour as in
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* Conversion\Pipeline\Generic\ARCHIFORMAT\spec.md (source:
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* SSG-Source\ARCHIFORMAT.TXT, UCS COBOL). The report and the
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* description are written by the skeleton's ECL steps first.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* SGSPARM (250): TB<base 6><table 30>
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>*                KY<key name 30><key type 1><key length 5>
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>*                RZ<rsz 5><columns 5>
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* Unload record (b = k + rsz + 1 + columns) up to 3998.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => PROGRAM-ID. 'ASSURFED-UTILIT-ARCHIFORMAT-GN'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => CONFIGURATION SECTION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => SOURCE-COMPUTER. UNIVAC-1100-10.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => OBJECT-COMPUTER. UNIVAC-1100-10.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FILE-CONTROL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     SELECT PARMF ASSIGN TO DISC SGSPARM.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     SELECT FIC-REPORT ASSIGN TO DISC ARFREP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     SELECT FIC-DESCRIPT ASSIGN TO DISC ARFDES.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     SELECT FIC-UNLOAD ASSIGN TO DISC ARFUNL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     SELECT FIC-FORMAT ASSIGN TO DISC ARFOUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => DATA DIVISION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FILE SECTION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FD  PARMF
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     LABEL RECORD STANDARD.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  PARM-REC.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  P-TYPE         PIC XX.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  P-REST         PIC X(248).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  PARM-TB-REC.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  FILLER         PIC XX.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  PT-BASE        PIC X(6).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  PT-TABLE       PIC X(30).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  FILLER         PIC X(212).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  PARM-KY-REC.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  FILLER         PIC XX.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  PK-NAME        PIC X(30).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  PK-TYPE        PIC X.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  PK-LEN         PIC 9(5).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  FILLER         PIC X(212).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  PARM-RZ-REC.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  FILLER         PIC XX.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  PR-RSZ         PIC 9(5).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  PR-COLS        PIC 9(5).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  FILLER         PIC X(238).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FD  FIC-REPORT
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     LABEL RECORD STANDARD.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  LGN-REP            PIC X(132).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FD  FIC-DESCRIPT
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     LABEL RECORD STANDARD.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  LGN-DES            PIC X(132).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FD  FIC-UNLOAD
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     LABEL RECORD STANDARD
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     RECORD VARYING IN SIZE FROM 1 TO 4001
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DEPENDING ON WS-UNL-LEN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  FIC-UNLOAD-REC     PIC X(4001).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FD  FIC-FORMAT
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     LABEL RECORD STANDARD.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  LGN-FOR            PIC X(4000).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  RECIN              PIC X(4001).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-UNL             PIC X(4000).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  WS-UNL-LEN         PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  CP-LEN             PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  P-K                PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  P-RSZ              PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  P-T                PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  P-B                PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  P-C                PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  P-D                PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  P-E                PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>*enregistrement type 0
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-DON-0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-0-TYP       PIC X VALUE '0'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-0-NM-BASE   PIC X(6).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-0-NM-TABLE  PIC X(30).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-0-DT-ACH    PIC 9(8).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-0-DT-MAJ.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>      05 WS-0-DT-MAJ-SS PIC 99.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>      05 WS-0-DT-MAJ-AA PIC 99.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>      05 WS-0-DT-MAJ-MM PIC 99.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>      05 WS-0-DT-MAJ-JJ PIC 99.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>*enregistrement type 1
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-DON-1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-1-TYP       PIC X VALUE '1'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-1-NM-CLE    PIC X(30).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-1-CLE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>      05 WS-1-TYP-CLE   PIC X.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>      05 WS-1-LG-CLE    PIC 99.99.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>*enregistrement type 2
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-DON-2.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-2-TYP       PIC X VALUE '2'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-2-NM-CHP    PIC X(30).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-2-TYP-CHP   PIC X(7).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-2-LG-CHP    PIC X(10).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-2-NULL      PIC X(8).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>*enregistrement type 3
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-DON-3.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-3-TYP       PIC X VALUE '3'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-3-NM-IDX    PIC X(30).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-3-NM-CHP    PIC X(30).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-3-TRI       PIC X(8).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>*enregistrement type 4 (cut at a = b + 1 by the record length)
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-DON-4.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-4-TYP       PIC XX VALUE '4A'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-4-DON       PIC X(3998).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>*enregistrement type 9
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-DON-9.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-9-TYP       PIC X VALUE '9'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-9-NM-BASE   PIC X(6).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-9-NM-TABLE  PIC X(30).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-9-DT-ACH    PIC 9(8).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-9-CPT-ACH   PIC S9(11) SIGN LEADING SEPARATE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-9-CPT-5     PIC X(12) VALUE '+00000000000'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  UNLOADF            PIC 9 VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  TABLE-NULL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  TNULL          PIC X OCCURS 70 TIMES.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  I                  PIC 99.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  I-BUF              PIC 99.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  I-TOT              PIC 99.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  FL-NULL            PIC 9.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  CPT-CHAR           PIC 999.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  CPT-ACH            PIC 9(11) VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  CPT-LU             PIC 9(11) VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  CPT-ACHF           PIC Z(10)9.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  CPT-LUF            PIC Z(10)9.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  DT-I.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  AA-I           PIC 9(4).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  MM-I           PIC 99.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  JJ-I           PIC 99.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  DT-FR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  JJ-FR          PIC 99.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  FILLER         PIC X VALUE '/'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  MM-FR          PIC 99.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  FILLER         PIC X VALUE '/'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  AA-FR          PIC 9(4).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => PROCEDURE DIVISION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => DEBUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     OPEN INPUT PARMF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => PARM-LECT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     READ PARMF AT END GO TO PARM-FIN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF P-TYPE = 'TB'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PT-BASE TO WS-0-NM-BASE WS-9-NM-BASE
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PT-TABLE TO WS-0-NM-TABLE WS-9-NM-TABLE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF P-TYPE = 'KY'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PK-NAME TO WS-1-NM-CLE
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PK-TYPE TO WS-1-TYP-CLE
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PK-LEN TO P-K.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF P-TYPE = 'RZ'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PR-RSZ TO P-RSZ
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PR-COLS TO P-T.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO PARM-LECT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => PARM-FIN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     CLOSE PARMF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     COMPUTE P-E = P-K + P-RSZ.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     COMPUTE P-D = P-E + 1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     COMPUTE P-C = P-E + 2.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     COMPUTE P-B = P-E + 1 + P-T.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     OPEN INPUT FIC-REPORT FIC-DESCRIPT FIC-UNLOAD
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>          OUTPUT FIC-FORMAT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM 100-TYPE0 THRU 100-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM 101-TYPE1 THRU 101-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM 102-TYPE2 THRU 102-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM 103-TYPE3 THRU 103-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM 104-TYPE4 THRU 104-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM 105-TYPE9 THRU 105-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM 106-TOT THRU 106-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     CLOSE FIC-REPORT FIC-DESCRIPT FIC-UNLOAD FIC-FORMAT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     STOP RUN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>*------------ ENREGISTREMENT DE TYPE 0 ----------------
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 100-TYPE0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ACCEPT WS-0-DT-ACH FROM DATE YYYYMMDD.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM 200-LEC-REPORT THRU 200-EXIT UNTIL LGN-REP (4:21)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>       = 'DD-PROCESS-TIME-STAMP'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM 200-LEC-REPORT THRU 200-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE LGN-REP (7:2) TO WS-0-DT-MAJ-AA.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF WS-0-DT-MAJ-AA > 90
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 19 TO WS-0-DT-MAJ-SS
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ELSE
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 20 TO WS-0-DT-MAJ-SS.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE LGN-REP (10:2) TO WS-0-DT-MAJ-MM.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE LGN-REP (13:2) TO WS-0-DT-MAJ-JJ.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     WRITE LGN-FOR FROM WS-DON-0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 100-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>*------------ ENREGISTREMENT DE TYPE 1 -----------------
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 101-TYPE1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE P-K TO WS-1-LG-CLE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     WRITE LGN-FOR FROM WS-DON-1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 101-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>*------------ ENREGISTREMENT DE TYPE 2 -----------------
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 102-TYPE2.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM 200-LEC-REPORT THRU 200-EXIT
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>       UNTIL LGN-REP (1:7) = 'Columns'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM 200-LEC-REPORT THRU 200-EXIT 2 TIMES.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 0 TO CPT-CHAR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     INSPECT LGN-REP TALLYING CPT-CHAR
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>                     FOR CHARACTERS
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>                     BEFORE INITIAL 'Allowed'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE CPT-CHAR TO I-BUF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM 200-LEC-REPORT THRU 200-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM 201-LEC-DESCRIPT THRU 201-EXIT 2 TIMES.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 0 TO CPT-CHAR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     INSPECT LGN-DES TALLYING CPT-CHAR
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>                     FOR CHARACTERS
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>                     BEFORE INITIAL 'TION.'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 6 TO CPT-CHAR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM 102-COL THRU 102-COL-EXIT P-T TIMES.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 102-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 102-COL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE LGN-DES (CPT-CHAR:30) TO WS-2-NM-CHP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE LGN-DES (6:7) TO WS-2-TYP-CHP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE LGN-DES (13:10) TO WS-2-LG-CHP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE LGN-REP TO TABLE-NULL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 3 TO I-BUF GIVING I.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 0 TO FL-NULL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 2 TO I GIVING I-TOT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM 102-NULL THRU 102-NULL-EXIT UNTIL I NOT < I-TOT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF FL-NULL = 1
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 'NULL' TO WS-2-NULL
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ELSE
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE SPACE TO WS-2-NULL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     WRITE LGN-FOR FROM WS-DON-2.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM 200-LEC-REPORT THRU 200-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM 201-LEC-DESCRIPT THRU 201-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 102-COL-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>*recherche [Y] et ensuite [E] pour NULL
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 102-NULL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF TNULL (I) = 'Y'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        ADD 1 TO I
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        IF TNULL (I) = 'E'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>           MOVE 1 TO FL-NULL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 1 TO I.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 102-NULL-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>*------------ ENREGISTREMENT DE TYPE 3 -----------------
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 103-TYPE3.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM 200-LEC-REPORT THRU 200-EXIT
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>       UNTIL LGN-REP (1:13) = 'Primary Key :'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 0 TO CPT-CHAR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     INSPECT LGN-REP TALLYING CPT-CHAR
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>                     FOR CHARACTERS
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>                     BEFORE INITIAL 'PK_'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 1 TO CPT-CHAR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE LGN-REP (CPT-CHAR:30) TO WS-3-NM-IDX.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM 200-LEC-REPORT THRU 200-EXIT 2 TIMES.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM 103-COL THRU 103-COL-EXIT
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>       UNTIL LGN-REP (1:10) = SPACE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 103-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 103-COL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 0 TO CPT-CHAR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     INSPECT LGN-REP TALLYING CPT-CHAR
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>                     FOR CHARACTERS
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>                     BEFORE INITIAL ','.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     SUBTRACT 4 FROM CPT-CHAR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE LGN-REP (5:CPT-CHAR) TO WS-3-NM-CHP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 7 TO CPT-CHAR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE LGN-REP (CPT-CHAR:3) TO WS-3-TRI.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     WRITE LGN-FOR FROM WS-DON-3.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM 200-LEC-REPORT THRU 200-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 103-COL-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>*------------ ENREGISTREMENT DE TYPE 4 -----------------
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 104-TYPE4.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM 104-REC THRU 104-REC-EXIT UNTIL UNLOADF = 1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 104-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 104-REC.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM 202-LEC-UNLOAD THRU 202-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF UNLOADF NOT = 1
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        WRITE LGN-FOR FROM WS-DON-4
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        ADD 1 TO CPT-ACH.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 104-REC-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>*------------ ENREGISTREMENT DE TYPE 9 -----------------
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 105-TYPE9.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ACCEPT WS-9-DT-ACH FROM DATE YYYYMMDD.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE CPT-ACH TO WS-9-CPT-ACH.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     WRITE LGN-FOR FROM WS-DON-9.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 105-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>*----------------- RAPPORT  -----------------
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 106-TOT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE CPT-ACH TO CPT-ACHF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE CPT-LU TO CPT-LUF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-0-DT-ACH TO DT-I.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE AA-I TO AA-FR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE MM-I TO MM-FR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE JJ-I TO JJ-FR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY 'ARCHIFORMAT          RAPPORT          '
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>       DT-FR UPON PRINTER.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY 'Enregistrements lus:' CPT-LUF UPON PRINTER.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY 'Enregistrements 4 écrits:' CPT-ACHF UPON PRINTER.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 106-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>*--------------- LECTURE DU REPORT --------------
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 200-LEC-REPORT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     READ FIC-REPORT
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>       AT END
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         DISPLAY 'fin du report' UPON PRINTER.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 200-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>*--------------- LECTURE DU DESCRIPT ------------
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 201-LEC-DESCRIPT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     READ FIC-DESCRIPT
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>       AT END
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         DISPLAY 'fin de la description' UPON PRINTER.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 201-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>*--------------- LECTURE DE L'UNLOAD --------------
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 202-LEC-UNLOAD.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE SPACES TO RECIN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     READ FIC-UNLOAD INTO RECIN
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>       AT END
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         MOVE 1 TO UNLOADF
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         GO TO 202-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE SPACES TO WS-UNL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-UNL-LEN TO CP-LEN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF CP-LEN > P-B
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE P-B TO CP-LEN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF CP-LEN > 0
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE RECIN (1:CP-LEN) TO WS-UNL (1:CP-LEN).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-UNL (1:P-E) TO WS-4-DON (1:P-E).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-UNL (P-C:P-T) TO WS-4-DON (P-D:P-T).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 1 TO CPT-LU.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 202-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     EXIT.
</DATA>
<DATA=Documentation>
  -MAP-
  Documentation
  * SSG-4 archive work (MT-050): one ARCHIFORMAT for all calls. Key,
  * record length, column count and names come from the SGSPARM
  * file written by the skeleton hand-off; behaviour as in
  * Conversion\Pipeline\Generic\ARCHIFORMAT\spec.md (source:
  * SSG-Source\ARCHIFORMAT.TXT, UCS COBOL). The report and the
  * description are written by the skeleton's ECL steps first.
  * SGSPARM (250): TB<base 6><table 30>
  *                KY<key name 30><key type 1><key length 5>
  *                RZ<rsz 5><columns 5>
  * Unload record (b = k + rsz + 1 + columns) up to 3998.
  PROGRAM-ID. .
  -MAPEND-
  -MAP-
  Technical issues
  -MAPEND-
</DATA>
<IN FOLDER>
COBOL
</IN FOLDER>
</OBJECT>
